{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>To a brook of איתן.</b> This is difficult — for it has never been worked." "<b>And break its neck.</b> He chops its neck with a cleaver. The Holy One, blessed be He, said: Let a yearling heifer that has not produced fruit come and be decapitated in a place that produces no fruit, to atone for the killing of this one who was not allowed to produce fruit (Sotah 46)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:47:50.821835544Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}